{"full_name":"borisbanushev/stockpredictionai","owner":"borisbanushev","name":"stockpredictionai","url":"https://github.com/borisbanushev/stockpredictionai","description":"       In this noteboook I will create a complete process for predicting stock price movements. Follow along and we will achieve some pretty good results. For that purpose we will use a Generative Adversarial Network (GAN) with LSTM, a type of Recurrent Neural Network, as generator, and a Convolutional Neural Network, CNN, as a discriminator. We use LSTM for the obvious reason that we are trying to predict time series data. Why we use GAN and specifically CNN as a discriminator? That is a good question: there are special sections on that later.","homepage":"","topics":[],"tag_pages":[],"language":"JavaScript","license":null,"avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36700291?u=2081b2b055a2d87a7093123a129f04466dfd07d5&v=4","created_at":"2019-01-09T08:02:47Z","pushed_at":"2025-08-19T04:04:58Z","metrics":{"stars":5606,"forks":1866,"watchers":289,"issues":307,"prs":84,"releases":0,"issues_open":300,"issues_closed":7,"prs_open":64,"prs_closed":20,"prs_merged":0,"discussions":0},"growth":{"day":{"stars":-3,"forks":0,"base_day":"2026-11-13"}},"history":{"dates":["2026-11-10","2026-11-11","2026-11-12","2026-11-13","2026-11-14"],"stars":[5607,5607,5608,5609,5606],"forks":[1867,1866,1866,1866,1866],"watchers":[null,289,289,289,289],"issues_open":[null,300,300,300,300],"prs_open":[null,64,64,64,64]},"boards":{},"same_owner":[],"issues":[{"number":18,"title":"VAE_data","comments":9,"created_at":"2019-02-17T00:19:15Z"},{"number":303,"title":"Code and Dataset Request","comments":7,"created_at":"2021-05-02T06:49:31Z"},{"number":19,"title":"FFT/Wavelet look-ahead bias","comments":7,"created_at":"2019-02-21T18:08:46Z"},{"number":13,"title":"could you please provide data and full code","comments":6,"created_at":"2019-01-31T09:28:34Z"},{"number":114,"title":"please do check if you have used future information